---
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
	title: string;
	description: string;
}

const { title, description } = Astro.props;
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).href;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

		<title>{title}</title>
		<meta name="description" content={description} />
		<link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
		<meta name="author" content="Golam Kibria" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0b0e" />
		<meta
			name="keywords"
			content="Golam Kibria, software engineer, full stack developer, Django, React, Vue, Node.js, AWS, GCP, RAG, machine learning, Bangladesh, remote"
		/>

		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
		<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
		<meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />

		<script
			type="application/ld+json"
			is:inline
			set:html={JSON.stringify({
				'@context': 'https://schema.org',
				'@type': 'Person',
				name: 'Golam Kibria',
				jobTitle: 'Software Engineer',
				url: 'https://g-k-shuvo.github.io',
				email: 'mailto:gkshuvo24@gmail.com',
				worksFor: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Techjays' },
				alumniOf: { '@type': 'CollegeOrUniversity', name: 'Metropolitan University' },
				address: { '@type': 'PostalAddress', addressCountry: 'BD' },
				sameAs: ['https://github.com/g-k-shuvo', 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/g-k-shuvo/']
			})}
		/>

		<script is:inline>
			// Analytics is 160KB of JavaScript. Loaded normally it evaluates during
			// first paint and costs ~600ms of blocking time on a mid-tier phone, so
			// it waits for idle instead. Nothing is lost: gtag() queues into
			// dataLayer immediately and the library drains the queue when it lands.
			window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
			function gtag() {
				dataLayer.push(arguments);
			}
			gtag('js', new Date());
			gtag('config', 'G-7XXPE0DV47');

			(function () {
				var loaded = false;
				function loadGA() {
					if (loaded) return;
					loaded = true;
					var s = document.createElement('script');
					s.async = true;
					s.src = 'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-7XXPE0DV47';
					document.head.appendChild(s);
				}
				function schedule() {
					if ('requestIdleCallback' in window) requestIdleCallback(loadGA, { timeout: 3000 });
					else setTimeout(loadGA, 2000);
				}
				if (document.readyState === 'complete') schedule();
				else window.addEventListener('load', schedule, { once: true });
				// A visitor who leaves before idle still gets counted.
				document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function () {
					if (document.visibilityState === 'hidden') loadGA();
				});
			})();
		</script>
	</head>

	<body>
		<!--
		THESIS: The category standard executed at material grade, chosen by the user over a
		dealt hand of committed worlds. Refuses the expressive concept portfolio and the
		generic dev template alike; the work is the only colour on the page.
		OWN-WORLD: True near-black #0B0B0E under a measured grain — a few levels off the
		floor because a black shadow needs somewhere to fall. Three plane tiers (#0D0D11
		sunken, #16161A base, #1C1C22 raised), each with a specular top edge lit at rest
		and a real offset shadow. Geist at three sizes, greyscale throughout, one
		functional live-green dot. No accent, no gradient, no eyebrow.
		STORY: A hiring manager skimming to disqualify learns in seconds that one engineer
		shipped seven enterprise domains end to end, finds the proof, and mails him.
		FIRST VIEWPORT: Name at display scale left, role and a two-sentence factual claim
		beneath it, live availability, a white Email pill as the primary action; portrait
		right on a raised plane catching the light. The Techjays index begins at the fold.
		FORM: Category standard — the standing exit, user-chosen against the roll; craft bar
		Raycast/Arc/Family; signature motion is the raking light. Seed key 153ed001.
		FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
		-->
		<div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<slot />

		<script>
			import { rakingLight } from '../scripts/raking-light';
			rakingLight();
		</script>
	</body>
</html>
